  "notes": {
    "open-decisions": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 800,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Checkout notes\n\n• Delivery instructions are an array in the contract; the handover choice is one of three (photo for Leave at the door, a code for Meet), plus two optional flags.\n• Tax: rows render the quote's tax lines verbatim; none at launch while the HST registration question is open. The service fee line always shows, even at $0.00 (owner decision).\n• Tip presets are customer inputs; the server validates tip_cents. Riders see the tip before they accept (owner decision).\n• Promo codes are a later release and are not drawn.\n• Package tamper seals are out of launch (owner decision), so checkout has no seal step.\n• One active order at a time (owner decision): Cart and Checkout stop a second order. An order under review doesn't count (owner decision, 1 October).\n• After createOrder the order exists unpaid with a 15-minute deadline: decline, bank confirmation failure and a closed wallet sheet all recover on the SAME payment, or cancel (free). A second createOrder is never sent.\n• Cart after a cancelled, expired or failed unpaid order (owner decision, 1 October): the cart is deleted when the order is created, so the cancelled, deadline-passed and retries-used-up boards offer \"Put these items back in your cart\", which re-adds the lines with the existing cart operations (one addCartLine per line); the server prices them again. No contract change. Its loading, error and cart-holds-another-restaurant states are frames 2 to 4 of Checkout — order cancelled; the result is the cart itself (Cart — default).\n• Still open: cancel reason at the payment stage. Drawn to the contract (customer picks a reason, nothing pre-selected); the alternative is a fixed \"changed my mind\" reason with no step.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2020
    },
    "split-from": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 300,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Split from HalalGoes Customer — Discover & Order: https://claude.ai/artifact/F2MfULPYoJQkkLsA5G3aFk",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300
    },
